# SlideServe

> SlideServe is an online platform for discovering, viewing, sharing, and publishing presentations and documents. It hosts user-generated slide decks and educational, professional, business, and general-interest content, and provides tools for creating and publishing presentations online.

SlideServe helps users find relevant presentation content, view slides online, share presentations with audiences, and publish their own materials. The platform supports presentation uploads, public and private visibility settings, and downloadable content where enabled by the publisher.

## Core Pages

- [Home](https://www.slideserve.com/): Discover presentations, featured content, topics, and platform features.
- [About SlideServe](https://www.slideserve.com/about): Learn about the platform, its purpose, and its services.
- [Featured Presentations](https://www.slideserve.com/featured): Explore selected and trending presentations.
- [Browse Topics](https://www.slideserve.com/topics): Explore presentations organized by subject and category.
- [Upload Presentations](https://www.slideserve.com/upload): Upload and publish supported presentation and document files.
